@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043

### Process liveness only; this does not assert database or collection readiness.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### OpenAPI is available only in Development.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Anonymous published device status (private devices and IP addresses are excluded).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/devices?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Anonymous published services and groups.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/services?page=1
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/groups?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Unimplemented API routes return 404 Problem Details.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/not-implemented
Accept: application/problem+json
